                            <P style="margin-top: 3.3pt; margin-bottom: 3.3pt; "><FONT style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif; "><font style='white-space: pre-wrap;'>Unless otherwise set forth in the applicable pricing supplement, the Exchange Period shall be each trading day from, and including, the Trade Date to, but excluding, a specified trading day prior to the first Valuation Date.</font></FONT></P>
